WEBVTT

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:06.150
Okay!

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:09.610
I think I managed to draw a 
great storyboard this time!

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:10.740
I'm rejecting this.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:12.190
Huh?

00:00:13.890 --> 00:00:15.280
First of all,

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:19.040
Despite everything
that happened,
we still got
to eat our cake

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:19.100
all the high school girls look the same.

00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:22.410
Actually, they don't even 
look like high school girls.

00:00:23.460 --> 00:00:24.910
Kaos-sensei!

00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:31.630
Th-There's been a terrible 
misunderstanding on my part...

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:36.320
I had the feeling I actually 
drew a good storyboard...

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:38.880
I'm so sorry! It was my mistake!

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.600
Kaos-sensei...

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:46.320
I'm so sorry for wasting your time.

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:51.030
The Sanctuary of Manga
Bunhousha

00:00:46.310 --> 00:00:51.030
Manga Time

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:51.030
I might've said too much...

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:11.340
Comic Girls

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:28.510
What's wrong?

00:02:28.510 --> 00:02:30.400
She's really depressed.

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:33.330
Apparently her storyboard got rejected again.

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:35.320
Ever since I met all of you,

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:39.790
I thought I was able to 
have fun drawing manga,

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:43.360
but nothing's really changed.

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:46.000
When I think that no one needs me...

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:50.160
That Amisawa-san doesn't need me...

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:52.000
I...

00:02:52.610 --> 00:02:55.700
At this rate, I'm just an embarrassment 
machine rather than a manga artist!

00:02:55.700 --> 00:02:57.990
No, <i>I'm</i> a disgrace!

00:02:58.000 --> 00:02:59.510
Calm down, Kaos-chan!

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:02.930
I know this is hard,

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:04.480
but you have to keep drawing.

00:03:04.480 --> 00:03:06.170
As long as you keep drawing,

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:09.750
someone will understand your art.

00:03:11.320 --> 00:03:13.200
Ruki-san...

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:15.170
Not to mention...

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:18.680
Manga artists pretty much make a 
living doing something shameful.

00:03:18.670 --> 00:03:21.430
Teens' Love Manga Artist

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:20.180
We're all a disgrace!

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:21.430
We're all in the same boat!

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:23.140
Ruki-san, your eyes are dead!

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:26.060
But I'm also drawing romances 
solely from delusions,

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:29.070
so it's really embarrassing 
when people I know read them!

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:32.770
I get chills when I see my 
debut because it was so bad.

00:03:34.450 --> 00:03:35.980
We're all a disgrace!

00:03:35.980 --> 00:03:36.990
We're all in the same boat!

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:41.990
<i>Everyone's so kind...</i>

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:45.110
I'm okay now.

00:03:45.110 --> 00:03:46.410
I'll do my best!

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:47.650
For now,

00:03:47.650 --> 00:03:50.370
why don't you try your best to become 
the protagonist in what you're drawing?

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:51.860
I see!

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:53.010
Then, first off,

00:03:53.010 --> 00:03:55.340
I'll try making my hair 
like the protagonist's!

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:07.870
They keep crossing over on
this side, no matter what I do...

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:09.440
The side that's not my dominant side.

00:04:09.460 --> 00:04:10.710
I'll do it for you!

00:04:10.710 --> 00:04:12.440
Yeah, I'll do it for you, too.

00:04:12.720 --> 00:04:15.480
If it's difficult for you 
to become the protagonist,

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:17.400
you could write with your fans in mind.

00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:23.480
After I found out that 
Nijino-sensei was a fan,

00:04:23.480 --> 00:04:27.380
any time I'm feeling down, I think about the 
fact that she's waiting for my manuscript.

00:04:27.380 --> 00:04:28.820
Then I try even harder.

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:34.040
I... don't have a single fan!

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:37.120
The survey for my debut...

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:38.820
g-got the worst results...

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:41.800
I've never even gotten any 
messages of support...

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:44.550
Kaos-sensei,
your manga is
the best in the world!
You can do it!!
(Moeta Haruko | Age: It's a secret)

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:44.550
You can do it!!

00:04:41.800 --> 00:04:44.550
When I thought I finally got 
one, it was from my mom...

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:46.260
That's so nice, but ouch!

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:48.060
I'm sorry...

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:50.430
We have tests coming up, don't we?

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:53.310
Ruki
Deadline!

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:53.310
Test

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:53.310
Tsubasa
Deadline!

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:53.300
We all need to study soon.

00:04:53.300 --> 00:04:55.810
I'm totally fine!

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:58.020
You totally don't seem fine at all!

00:05:01.690 --> 00:05:03.840
I'm worried about Kaos-chan.

00:05:03.840 --> 00:05:04.870
Yeah...

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:07.830
I'm annoyed at myself for not being 
able to give her any good advice.

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:13.920
Koyume-chan,

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:17.240
I'm sorry if I'm emanating a depressing aura.

00:05:17.240 --> 00:05:20.020
That must be distracting when 
you're trying to study.

00:05:20.020 --> 00:05:20.890
Hm?

00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:22.960
Itsh totally fine, Kaos-chan.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.980
I don't study at all!

00:05:24.980 --> 00:05:25.710
So pure!

00:05:25.710 --> 00:05:29.040
More importantly, lets talk about 
manga to get more motivated!

00:05:29.040 --> 00:05:32.240
This is a character from 
the new manga I'm drawing!

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:33.930
Special Kanji Drills

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:36.060
♥ Won a
Nobel-something-
or-other
Award
♥ IQ 500

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:33.890
IQ 500...

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:36.060
Senpai

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:36.060
Won a Nobel-something-or-other Award?

00:05:36.450 --> 00:05:37.380
Yeah!

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:40.770
It's a love story with the 
smartest senpai in school!

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:42.060
This is already messed up!

00:05:42.060 --> 00:05:44.470
And he, like, approaches her in English!

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:45.530
Blah Blah

00:05:44.470 --> 00:05:45.520
<i>This is a pen...</i>

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:47.030
Doesn't that make your heart pound?!

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:51.990
Huh!? My heart's racing because 
he's approaching me in English!!

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:51.990
<i>This is a pen! This is a pen! This is a pen!</i>

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:51.990
Blah Blah Blah

00:05:48.140 --> 00:05:49.470
Koyume-chan,

00:05:49.470 --> 00:05:52.220
that senpai doesn't seem smart at all!

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:53.520
No way!

00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:56.210
But it's okay, this is 
where it gets really good!

00:05:56.210 --> 00:05:59.210
An even smarter teacher character appears

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:00.880
and it becomes a love triangle!

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:01.690
<i>Is this a pen?</i>

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:02.630
He turned
it into a
question!?

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:01.720
That's no different...

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:02.900
and they have the same face.

00:06:03.580 --> 00:06:05.860
Koyume-chan, let's just study for now.

00:06:05.860 --> 00:06:07.140
I'll do my best, too.

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:09.090
Japanese History

00:06:08.520 --> 00:06:11.560
Let's start with history 
since there's a lot on the test.

00:06:12.610 --> 00:06:15.040
Multiply... Equals...

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:16.640
Multiply... Equals...

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.800
Multiply... Equals...

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:22.100
Multiply... Equals...

00:06:19.030 --> 00:06:22.100
What are you calculating?

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:24.740
My hair pins?!

00:06:24.740 --> 00:06:28.290
I feel like doing math 
when I see those hairpins.

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:29.490
I-I'm so sorry!

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:32.530
But let's concentrate on history for now!

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:33.930
Okay!

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:35.450
Okay, here's a question.

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:38.370
What happened in the year 1221?

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.880
1221?

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:43.590
Woof... Meow... Woof Meow Meow Woof Festival?

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:45.630
Woof Meow Meow Woof Festival?!

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:48.660
Woof Meow Meow Woof Festival!

00:06:48.660 --> 00:06:50.550
Woof Meow Meow Woof Festival!

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:52.540
Woof Meow Meow Woof Festival!

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:54.240
Woof Meow Meow Woof Festival!

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:56.310
Woof Meow Meow Woof Festival!

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:57.450
Woof, meow...?

00:06:57.450 --> 00:06:58.970
Meow, meow?

00:06:58.970 --> 00:06:59.570
Yeah!

00:06:59.570 --> 00:07:00.980
Ruki-san, Tsubasa-san!

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:03.090
We don't know how to study!

00:07:03.090 --> 00:07:04.230
Help us!

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:07.010
Right...

00:07:07.010 --> 00:07:10.130
Let's forget about meows and 
woofs and hold a study session.

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:12.680
Yeah, tests are coming up really soon.

00:07:12.680 --> 00:07:14.620
Thank you very much!

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:19.780
Hey, you got this wrong.

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:22.050
You made the same mistake again.

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:24.540
That's what you need to work on, Kaos-chan.

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:26.020
And Koyume-chan...

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:28.550
hasn't learned a damn thing!

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:31.460
You were thinking about sweets

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:33.640
and Tsu-chan during class, weren't you?

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:33.640
It will come to be
if you draw it

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:38.370
I have a feeling Ruki-san 
sees through everything.

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:39.590
It's so embarrassing!

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:40.860
Ruki-chan, you perv!

00:07:40.860 --> 00:07:41.890
That's a false accusation!

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:48.020
Looks like you're finally getting it.

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:50.520
See? You can do it if you try, Kaos-chan.

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:52.960
I was always really good at 
school until middle school.

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:57.000
Oh, so you're the type whose grades started 
to slip once you started drawing manga.

00:07:57.000 --> 00:07:58.320
Tsu-chan's the same way.

00:07:58.320 --> 00:08:01.530
But in my case, my manga's a mess, too...

00:08:01.530 --> 00:08:03.200
Kaos-chan's falling apart again!

00:08:03.200 --> 00:08:04.920
I'm sorry, Kaos-chan!

00:08:04.920 --> 00:08:07.070
Let's forget about manga for now.

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:08.910
Let's get back to work.

00:08:09.190 --> 00:08:10.750
Sob, sob...

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:12.980
Their attention span is completely shot!

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:13.810
Tsu-chan!

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:17.220
The Dark Hero is immortal!

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:20.930
Slash! Slash, slash!

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:20.930
She had no intention of 
studying in the first place...

00:08:21.730 --> 00:08:23.490
Good work, everyone.

00:08:23.490 --> 00:08:24.440
I've brought you a treat.

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:25.600
Matron!

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:27.200
But if we eat anything right now,

00:08:27.200 --> 00:08:28.690
Koyume-chan's going to completely fall asleep!

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:32.070
Okay, here's your treat!

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:36.420
She's so soothing!

00:08:36.420 --> 00:08:39.400
You look so cute in that hat, Nyaos-sensei!

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:41.070
I know! There, there.

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:45.790
Slash! Slash! Slash! Slash!

00:08:42.090 --> 00:08:45.110
All right, work hard.

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.500
Okay, let's do this.

00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:51.090
What matters most in doing 
both manga and studying

00:08:51.090 --> 00:08:52.300
is switching quickly
from one to the other!

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:55.380
Let's concentrate and finish 
so we can draw our manga!

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:56.500
Right!

00:08:56.500 --> 00:09:00.200
The Kamakura Shogunate began in 1185

00:09:00.200 --> 00:09:02.300
and Minamoto no Yoritomo...

00:09:01.140 --> 00:09:02.290
Hold it!

00:09:02.670 --> 00:09:04.060
That's not right.

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:07.810
That era should've been a tumultuous time 
where the Demon Lord ruled over the land!

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:10.270
You're talking about your manga, Tsu-chan!

00:09:10.570 --> 00:09:13.460
But the vocabulary in 
history books are so hard.

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:15.390
They're really difficult to learn.

00:09:15.390 --> 00:09:18.280
Yeah... I can't remember any of this.

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:19.780
In that case...

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:21.620
Goseibai Shikimoku!

00:09:21.890 --> 00:09:23.330
What's wrong?

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:26.260
If you say the words and pose like 
you're doing a special attack,

00:09:26.260 --> 00:09:27.500
they're easier to remember.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.830
I see!

00:09:29.070 --> 00:09:30.800
Goseibai Shikimoku!

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:32.550
Emperor Go-Toba!

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:34.500
Emperor Go-Toba!

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:36.040
Jokyu War!

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:37.220
Jokyu War!

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:39.860
They're both really into it...

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:39.040
Masako Hojo!

00:09:39.040 --> 00:09:41.300
Masako Hojo!

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:41.320
Yeah...

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:49.120
Where was this again?

00:09:49.880 --> 00:09:54.220
<i>It's clear that Wing V-sensei and 
the others didn't get any sleep.</i>

00:09:54.220 --> 00:09:58.400
<i>Thank you for working so hard to 
balance academics and manga work.</i>

00:09:58.400 --> 00:09:59.730
Sensei...

00:10:00.500 --> 00:10:01.810
Help me...

00:10:01.810 --> 00:10:02.890
Huh? Of course!

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:04.840
I can at least apply screentones!

00:10:04.840 --> 00:10:07.220
No, I mean, there's a 
problem I don't understand.

00:10:07.220 --> 00:10:07.960
Huh?

00:10:07.960 --> 00:10:10.860
<i>You dummy! I'm their teacher!</i>

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:14.800
<i>I have to view Wing V-sensei as 
a student, not a manga artist!</i>

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:16.180
Sensei...

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:19.120
Yes, on this problem...

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:20.780
I want it...

00:10:20.780 --> 00:10:23.220
Sensei, could you let go of my notebook?

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:24.930
Damn it!

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:28.910
I wanted to remain a composed 
adult in front of my students!

00:10:28.910 --> 00:10:31.280
I've never done something so embarrassing!

00:10:31.280 --> 00:10:32.770
What am I going to do?

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:34.370
Hey, are you listening?!

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:35.460
<i>Now, now...</i>

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:38.780
<i>Then let's have some drinks as we 
talk about Tsubasa-chan's manga.</i>

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:41.570
Yeah! I'm totally drinking 
after their tests end!

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:44.780
Then we're going to have to 
invite one more person.

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:50.450
<i>I hope all the manga 
artists are doing okay.</i>

00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:53.920
<i>Irokawa-san seems all right.</i>

00:10:54.890 --> 00:10:57.380
<i>Moeta-san, relax.</i>

00:10:59.090 --> 00:11:00.600
<i>Sensei! Wake up!</i>

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:05.020
<i>I wonder how Koizuka-san is doing...</i>

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:06.440
Huh?

00:11:06.440 --> 00:11:08.440
What pose was this again?

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:10.980
Koizuka-san, what are you doing?!

00:11:10.520 --> 00:11:11.980
"Koyume supplementary exams confirmed"

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:17.980
Episode 8
"Woof Meow
Meow Woof Festival"

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:17.980
All I can
remember
is Tsubasa-san...

00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:15.500
Huh?

00:11:17.980 --> 00:11:20.450
Shudo
Hanakura
Shizuoka Oden

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:20.960
Cheers!

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:22.700
Specialty
Shizuoka Oden

00:11:20.930 --> 00:11:22.800
Good work!

00:11:26.260 --> 00:11:29.120
I can finally relax, 
now that all the tests are done!

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:33.010
I finished proofreading the 
magazine, so I'm free today, too.

00:11:33.010 --> 00:11:38.460
I've got it rough, too, playing with 
a kitten and talking to girls.

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:41.220
Your life seems really fun.

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:43.280
It is.

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:44.930
Being a matron of a manga 
artist dorm is great.

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:48.450
I bought the magazines that 
had their works in it!

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:50.780
You're such a fangirl, Miharun.

00:11:50.780 --> 00:11:53.790
Well, professional manga artists are amazing!

00:11:55.140 --> 00:11:56.230
Yeah...

00:11:56.660 --> 00:11:58.980
You can't become one just 
because you're good at art.

00:11:58.980 --> 00:12:01.700
You need confidence and an unbreakable will.

00:12:02.550 --> 00:12:04.020
They're all great girls.

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:06.050
Yeah...

00:12:08.050 --> 00:12:09.550
What's wrong?

00:12:09.550 --> 00:12:14.770
I actually want to compliment 
Kaos-sensei more.

00:12:14.770 --> 00:12:16.790
Then why don't you?

00:12:17.190 --> 00:12:20.230
What good would that do 
when her manga's so boring?!

00:12:20.230 --> 00:12:21.940
And she's already drunk.

00:12:21.940 --> 00:12:24.780
I can't lie!

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:26.140
Even today...

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:28.800
I was brutally honest.

00:12:29.190 --> 00:12:34.060
I feel like Kaos-sensei has promise, 
but she's no good right now.

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:36.370
At this rate, she's going to 
fail at being a manga artist...

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:37.370
or something.

00:12:37.370 --> 00:12:38.810
That's a bit...

00:12:38.810 --> 00:12:40.770
Poor Moeta-san.

00:12:42.570 --> 00:12:46.320
What if she quits being a 
manga artist because of me?

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:49.570
Kaos-sensei!

00:12:49.570 --> 00:12:52.870
Kaos-sensei!

00:12:50.460 --> 00:12:52.870
She's just as negative as her.

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:55.170
She's always been like that.

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:56.080
Yup.

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:58.460
Don't quit!

00:12:57.370 --> 00:13:02.160
Drawing manga was all we did
ten years ago, too.

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:04.300
It was so much fun.

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:08.270
It's a pretty dark history...

00:13:09.410 --> 00:13:11.460
And there's plenty I don't want to remember.

00:13:11.460 --> 00:13:13.280
I thought you'd say that,

00:13:13.280 --> 00:13:15.600
so I brought the magazine 
we made in Manga Club together.

00:13:15.780 --> 00:13:17.570
This woman...

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:20.420
Doesn't it take you back?

00:13:23.000 --> 00:13:27.170
The girls on the cover should 
totally be lovey-dovey.

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:28.320
What are you talking about?

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:31.250
Everyone wants to see two boys together!

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:35.330
Come on, then it won't 
be approachable to everyone.

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:37.040
I'll draw the cover.

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:41.140
My drawings have a charm 
that attracts one and all.

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:44.290
And this is the cover we got.

00:13:45.250 --> 00:13:46.860
I'm so sorry!

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:49.730
Your manga's so funny, Mayu.

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:53.890
She's like a celebrity

00:13:49.720 --> 00:13:55.430
Wow, she's so stylish!

00:13:49.730 --> 00:13:52.970
The parts that you didn't mean 
to be funny are the best.

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:54.280
I'm so sorry I suck!

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:55.430
Please just stop!

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:58.660
Wait, doesn't this look 
like Kaos-chan's manga?

00:13:58.660 --> 00:13:59.640
You're right.

00:13:59.640 --> 00:14:01.640
Hey, I'm definitely better.

00:14:01.640 --> 00:14:03.770
<i>She's definitely got more pride, though.</i>

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:06.680
Well, Kaos-chan will be fine.

00:14:06.680 --> 00:14:08.450
What do you mean?

00:14:08.490 --> 00:14:14.910
Rejected

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:14.910
Because she's surrounded by 
wonderful friends, just like we were back then.

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:19.990
I hope she continues to draw manga.

00:14:20.240 --> 00:14:23.960
I guess we all ended up quitting.

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:25.060
Right?

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:27.670
It's not funny!

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:31.620
That's why I'm so worried about 
the dorms being torn down.

00:14:31.620 --> 00:14:33.680
Wait, that's final?

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:35.200
It looks like it.

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:38.020
I heard that it was eventually 
going to happen, but...

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:39.390
When is it?

00:14:39.390 --> 00:14:40.530
Well...

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:44.660
They're saying sometime from the 
beginning of the year to spring.

00:14:44.660 --> 00:14:48.360
I wonder if those girls will 
be okay when they're separated

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:51.110
Festival

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.360
especially Kaos-chan...

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:52.340
I know.

00:14:52.340 --> 00:14:53.990
Since we're all here, why don't 
we go drink at my place?

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:58.160
Come to think of it, your 
place is in the dorms, right?

00:14:58.160 --> 00:14:59.650
I sort of want to see.

00:14:59.650 --> 00:15:03.370
But I can't get drunk if my 
students are on the same premises,

00:15:03.370 --> 00:15:05.550
or rather, in the same building!

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:09.270
Who was it again

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:12.040
that said they couldn't get drunk 
in the building their students live in?

00:15:12.040 --> 00:15:14.450
Well, it's too cozy in here.

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:17.570
Ririka-senpai, your waifu 
skills are too strong.

00:15:17.570 --> 00:15:18.280
Yis.

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:21.120
I think that even if I don't get married,

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:24.860
I could be happy with having you take 
care of me for the rest of my life, Ririka.

00:15:24.860 --> 00:15:25.360
Huh?

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:28.410
Yay! Please! Promise!

00:15:28.410 --> 00:15:29.320
Promise?!

00:15:29.320 --> 00:15:31.950
You should take that back right now.

00:15:31.950 --> 00:15:35.990
No matter how much Ririka-senpai 
drinks, her memory is always intact.

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:39.230
By the way, Miharun, your makeup's a mess.

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:40.510
Go wash your face.

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:44.290
I feel so much better.

00:15:44.910 --> 00:15:45.990
She looks like a baby without makeup!

00:15:45.990 --> 00:15:47.760
Looks like we have a teenage runaway.

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:48.960
What the hell?

00:15:48.960 --> 00:15:50.780
I'm self-conscious about that so shut up!

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:53.010
What? I would love to have a baby face.

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:56.500
I thought you looked a little 
more mature once you got a job,

00:15:56.500 --> 00:16:00.100
but I guess you were just trying really 
hard to look more like a teacher.

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:00.930
Shut up!

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:02.230
Ririka, lend me some loungewear!

00:16:02.590 --> 00:16:04.180
I already set some out.

00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:08.100
A uniform?

00:16:08.100 --> 00:16:09.810
Well, whatever.

00:16:09.810 --> 00:16:10.880
She doesn't mind, apparently.

00:16:10.880 --> 00:16:13.120
Well, she did drink quite a bit.

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:14.900
Let me read some manga.

00:16:14.900 --> 00:16:17.620
That shelf is filled with manga the 
girls from this dorm have drawn.

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:19.660
Wow, that's amazing!

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:21.550
Let's see... who drew what?

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:25.380
A copy with Wing V-sensei's autograph in it!

00:16:25.380 --> 00:16:26.930
It's super rare.

00:16:28.010 --> 00:16:30.800
I wonder what her office looks like.

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:33.560
I would love to see her 
ink a page in person.

00:16:33.560 --> 00:16:35.960
I want her autograph!

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:35.960
You're being a nuisance.

00:16:36.940 --> 00:16:41.270
Tsubasa-chan's really nice, 
so I think she'd be okay with it.

00:16:42.110 --> 00:16:43.360
Really?

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:49.060
Do you think she'd draw me an illustration 
of the Demon Lord x Black-kyun if I asked?!

00:16:49.060 --> 00:16:51.520
Don't! You'll regret it in the morning!

00:16:52.580 --> 00:16:53.490
Matron.

00:16:54.690 --> 00:16:55.610
Tsubasa-chan?

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:58.820
Sorry, I ran out of screentones.

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:01.660
The god has descended! 
The god has descended!

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:03.220
Thank you!

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:04.720
Holy crap, what do I do?!

00:17:04.720 --> 00:17:06.850
Eek! She has screentone bits on her shoulder!

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:09.460
Is it for... Is it for Black-kyun's cape?!

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:10.920
Down, girl.

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:12.200
Tsubasa-chan,

00:17:12.200 --> 00:17:14.020
there should be some screentones in storage.

00:17:14.020 --> 00:17:14.780
Who is that?

00:17:14.780 --> 00:17:16.130
A relative of yours?

00:17:16.130 --> 00:17:18.210
If you can't tell, 
just forget you ever saw her.

00:17:20.680 --> 00:17:22.340
Holy crap!

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:24.260
What should I do, Mayu?! This is so much fun!

00:17:24.260 --> 00:17:25.810
Please just calm down!

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:27.770
Someone's here again!

00:17:27.770 --> 00:17:29.730
Um...

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:31.610
I wanted to ask...

00:17:31.610 --> 00:17:34.610
which sounded scarier... for my storyboard!

00:17:36.640 --> 00:17:37.760
Riri-chan!

00:17:37.760 --> 00:17:40.430
I cut my finger with a razor. 
Do you have any bandages?

00:17:40.430 --> 00:17:42.740
Huh? Fuura-senpai?

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:43.840
Who's that?

00:17:43.840 --> 00:17:46.580
The matron will be right back!

00:17:49.610 --> 00:17:53.220
I guess being a matron keeps you pretty busy.

00:17:53.220 --> 00:17:55.010
Well, it's the weekend,

00:17:55.010 --> 00:17:57.380
so everyone's staying up pretty late.

00:17:57.380 --> 00:18:00.710
Does Kaos-sensei come here, too?

00:18:00.710 --> 00:18:04.870
Kaos-chan comes by once in a while, 
when her tummy gets cold and she can't sleep.

00:18:04.870 --> 00:18:06.480
That has nothing to do with manga...

00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:10.800
She's in such an ideal 
environment for ideas...

00:18:10.800 --> 00:18:13.200
What is she even learning?

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:16.530
She's probably watching some 
late-night anime right now,

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:19.100
trying to escape reality.

00:18:19.100 --> 00:18:20.770
Where are you going?

00:18:21.220 --> 00:18:24.320
Since I'm here, I'm going to 
give Kaos-sensei a piece of my mind.

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:25.540
Oh, my.

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:28.480
Kaos-chan, Kaos-chan!

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:31.030
That anime you like is starting.

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:34.100
This episode looked like it is going to be

00:18:34.100 --> 00:18:36.710
a god-tier episode, judging from the episode 
preview, so I was looking forward to it!

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:41.350
B-But if I watch and enjoy anime

00:18:41.350 --> 00:18:43.490
while I'm drawing rejected manga 
storyboards one after another,

00:18:43.490 --> 00:18:46.780
I'll be cursed with rejected 
storyboards forever!

00:18:46.780 --> 00:18:48.680
Don't worry, it'll be okay.

00:18:50.640 --> 00:18:54.850
But I think this one was worse 
than the last one I did.

00:18:54.850 --> 00:18:58.000
Now I'm thinking too much 
and I just don't know.

00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:01.400
I think you're supposed to smile and 
enjoy some treats when that happens.

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:06.580
A message from Amisawa-san?

00:19:06.740 --> 00:19:11.960
Thank you very much! 
I'll head there at that time.

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:10.440
<i>I think artists who struggle with 
storyboards as much as you, Kaos-sensei,</i>

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:16.300
<i>get ideas by watching as many 
great series as they can.</i>

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:15.250
I think artists who struggle with storyboards as much as you,
Kaos-sensei, get ideas by watching as many great series
as they can. The more you brood over it, the worse your
ideas get, so make sure you relax at times.

00:19:16.300 --> 00:19:17.890
<i>The more you brood over it,</i>

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:20.210
<i>the worse your ideas get,</i>

00:19:20.210 --> 00:19:22.220
<i>so make sure you relax at times.</i>

00:19:22.400 --> 00:19:24.450
Such detailed advice!

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:25.840
It's like she was right here watching me!

00:19:25.840 --> 00:19:27.810
Editors are absolutely amazing!

00:19:31.220 --> 00:19:35.170
How'd it go? Did you give 
Kaos-sensei a piece of your mind?

00:19:36.130 --> 00:19:39.490
You were actually nice to Kaos-chan for once.

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:41.960
That was the best I could do right now.

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:47.730
I don't want Kaos-sensei to stop drawing.

00:19:48.110 --> 00:19:50.330
Every single time I reject her proposals,

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:52.480
her eyes are literally filled with tears,

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:54.370
and she trembles so much, 
like she's going to die.

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:56.990
Even then, in a couple of days,

00:19:56.990 --> 00:20:00.340
she's all chipper and brings 
me her next storyboard.

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:05.380
U-Um... could you look... I'm so embarrassed!

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:07.440
This is amazing!

00:20:07.440 --> 00:20:08.500
Do you even understand?!

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:09.510
Yup.

00:20:09.510 --> 00:20:12.020
You absolutely adore Kaos-chan.

00:20:13.460 --> 00:20:15.220
She got the worst results 
possible on her survey,

00:20:15.220 --> 00:20:17.980
and didn't have a single 
fan to support her...

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:21.780
Could you even think about drawing 
your next project after that?!

00:20:22.480 --> 00:20:25.700
Kaos-sensei is such a strong girl.

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:28.660
Yup, Moeta-san deserves praise.

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:30.790
Yup, you're right.

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:36.040
Kaos-sensei

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:36.040
Now

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:36.040
New message received.
Tap for more

00:20:34.310 --> 00:20:36.040
Kaos-sensei...

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:40.760
Amisawa-san, thank you very much for the message.
And thank you for always reading my awful
storyboards to the very end.

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:40.760
I think artists who struggle with storyboards
as much as you, Kaos-sensei, get ideas by
watching as many great series as they can.
The more you brood over it, the worse
your ideas get, so make sure you relax at times.

00:20:37.120 --> 00:20:38.590
<i>Amisawa-san,</i>

00:20:38.590 --> 00:20:41.210
<i>thank you very much for the message.</i>

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:42.340
Crêpes and
High School Girls

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:42.340
It's about to begin!

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:47.360
<i>And thank you for always reading my 
awful storyboards to the very end.</i>

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:44.340
So sweet

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:44.340
it melts in your mouth~

00:20:42.760 --> 00:20:44.340
So rich

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:44.340
Minch Minch

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:46.010
Has big
boobs!!

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:46.010
Super pretty otaku teacher | Miharu-sensei

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:46.010
Really pretty!! Really nice!!

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:51.220
<i>I'll bring a much better 
storyboard by next week.</i>

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:54.140
Amisawa-san, thank you very much for the message.
And thank you for always reading my awful
storyboards to the very end. I'll bring a
much better storyboard by next week.

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:54.140
I'll do my best!

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:53.290
<i>I'll do my best!</i>

00:20:56.890 --> 00:20:58.110
All right...

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:01.110
Kaos-sensei

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:02.820
Kaos-sensei

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:04.120
Kaos-sensei!

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:04.130
<i>Hello—</i>

00:21:04.120 --> 00:21:05.570
If you're going to raise the bar,

00:21:05.570 --> 00:21:07.570
you'd better make your manga 
interesting, or you'll be sorry!

00:21:07.570 --> 00:21:09.330
<i>Y-Yes, ma'am?!</i>

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:10.320
Goodnight!

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:22.130
Kaos-sensei is such a nice, earnest girl.

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:27.000
Why don't you just tell her that in person?

00:23:01.410 --> 00:23:04.320
Kaos-sensei, how'd your tests go?

00:23:04.320 --> 00:23:07.290
I-I think I managed to avoid failing them.

00:23:07.290 --> 00:23:11.780
N-Now I-I'll be able to 
concentrate on my manga,

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:13.510
s-so I'll do my best!

00:23:14.280 --> 00:23:15.700
I look forward to it.

00:23:15.700 --> 00:23:18.450
So, about your storyboard this time...

00:23:18.450 --> 00:23:19.340
Yes?

00:23:19.340 --> 00:23:22.400
I think I'm rather harsh every time,

00:23:22.400 --> 00:23:26.210
so I changed my methods slightly to 
make it look like I was grading a test.

00:23:23.920 --> 00:23:26.920
This makes no sense

00:23:26.210 --> 00:23:29.920
I failed!

00:23:30.480 --> 00:23:33.410
I'm so worried about my 
weight that I can't draw...

00:23:33.410 --> 00:23:35.630
And whenever that happens... you need meat!

00:23:35.630 --> 00:23:37.220
Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:23:37.220 --> 00:23:39.320
Next time, "Kaospiral."

00:23:37.640 --> 00:23:39.930
Kaospiral
